o at Centennial Plaza","subtitle":"Stop 8 · Re-enter campus through a mapped landmark","notes":"Locate the plaza and tower on the current campus map, pause for an exterior photo, and use the landmark to trace your route back east.","short_summary":"Practice navigating campus with a visually distinct mapped destination.","evidence_claim":"Louisiana Tech’s July 2025 campus map identifies Centennial Plaza/Centennial Tower as campus landmark number 12.","source_url":"https://www.latech.edu/documents/campus-map-july-2025.pdf","source_title":"Louisiana Tech University Campus Map — July 2025","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Plan this as an exterior stop; temporary event restrictions and interior tower access are not established by the map.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"latech-f-jay-taylor-visual-arts-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"F. Jay Taylor Visual Arts Center","title":"Find the Visual Arts Center","subtitle":"Stop 9 · Add an arts landmark to your campus map","notes":"Walk to the named arts center, photograph the exterior, and check building postings before attempting to enter any gallery or studio.","short_summary":"Round out the campus tour with a clearly mapped arts destination.","evidence_claim":"Louisiana Tech’s July 2025 campus map identifies the F. Jay Taylor Visual Arts Center as campus destination number 22.","source_url":"https://www.latech.edu/documents/campus-map-july-2025.pdf","source_title":"Louisiana Tech University Campus Map — July 2025","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Treat this as an exterior wayfinding stop unless current gallery or building access is posted on site.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lat