bright bowling alley has six lanes and automatic scoring and is free for currently enrolled Louisiana Tech students with valid ID.","source_url":"https://www.latech.edu/student-life/student-support-and-resources/intramural-sports-recreation/bowling-alley.php","source_title":"Bowling Alley","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Friday hours are 9 a.m.–10 p.m. A valid student or member ID is required; facility areas may be unavailable for reservations.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"latech-lambright-rock-wall","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Lambright Rock Wall","title":"Saturday Climb at Lambright","subtitle":"Stop 5 · Try the recreation center’s belay-equipped wall","notes":"Arrive during the Saturday climbing window, wear closed-toe shoes, and follow staff instructions before using an auto-belay route.","short_summary":"Begin Saturday with a supervised indoor recreation option.","evidence_claim":"Louisiana Tech states that the Lambright rock wall is 29.5 feet tall with two manual belays and six auto-belays.","source_url":"https://www.latech.edu/student-life/student-support-and-resources/intramural-sports-recreation/lambright-sports-wellness-center/rock-wall.php","source_title":"Rock Wall","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Saturday rock-wall hours are noon–4 p.m. Valid student or member ID is required; current students use Lambright free.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"latech-garland-gregory-hideaway-park","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Garland Gregory Hideaway Park","title":"Walk Hideaway Park","subtitle":"Stop 6 · Follow the trail beside the seven-acre lake","notes":"Visit during daylight, choose the walking trail or disc-golf course, and avoid entering reserved pavilions or the ropes course uninvited.","short_summary":"Shift outdoors for a flexible campus-park break.","evidence_claim":"Louisiana Tech says Hideaway Park is open daily during daylight and contains a hilly trail, pavilions, an 18-hole disc-golf course, and a seven-acre lake.","source_url":"https://www.latech.edu/student-life/student-support-and-resources/intramural-sports-recreation/hideaway-park.php","source_title":"Hideaway Park","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open every day during daylight hours. The low-ropes course requires group scheduling; pavilion reservations may affect availability.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"ruston-railroad-park","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Railroad Park","title":"Explore Downtown from Railroad Park","subtitle":"Stop 7 · Use the city park as a downtown waypoint","notes":"Start at the park’s West Park Avenue address, scan posted event notices, and keep any shopping or dining choices optional.","short_summary":"Add a simple downtown Ruston stop without depending on a scheduled event.","evidence_claim":"Experience Ruston lists Railroad Park at 101 W. Park Ave. and describes it as a city park and downtown event venue near shops and eateries.","source_url":"https://www.rustonlincoln.com/directory/railroad-park/","source_title":"Railroad Park | Experience Ruston","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor public venue; check posted notices because concerts, festivals, and other events can change access conditions.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"latech-centennial-plaza-tower","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Centennial Plaza and Centennial Tower","title":"Saturday Photo at Centennial Plaza","subtitle":"Stop 8 · Re-enter campus through a mapped landmark","notes":"Locate the plaza and tower on the current campus map, pause for an exterior photo, and use the landmark to trace your route back east.","short_summary":"Practice navigating campus with a visually distinct mapped destination.","evidence_claim":"Louisiana Tech’s July 2025 campus map identifies Centennial Plaza/Centennial Tower as campus landmark number 12.","source_url":"https://www.latech.edu/documents/campus-map-july-2025.pdf","source_title":"Louisiana Tech University Campus Map — July 2025","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Plan this as an exterior stop; temporary event restrictions and interior tower access are not established by the map.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"latech-f-jay-taylor-visual-arts-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"F. Jay Taylor Visual Arts Center","title":"Find the Visual Arts Center","subtitle":"Stop 9 · Add an arts landmark to your campus map","notes":"Walk to the named arts center, photograph the exterior, and check building postings before attempting to enter any gallery or studio.","short_summary":"Round out the campus tour with a clearly mapped arts destination.","evidence_claim":"Louisiana Tech’s July 2025 campus map identifies the F. Jay Taylor Visual Arts Center as campus destination number 22.","source_url":"https://www.latech.edu/documents/campus-map-july-2025.pdf","source_title":"Louisiana Tech University Campus Map — July 2025","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Treat this as an exterior wayfinding stop unless current gallery or building access is posted on site.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"latech-prescott-memorial-library","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Prescott Memorial Library","title":"Sunday Reset at Prescott Library","subtitle":"Stop 10 · Close the weekend by preparing for Monday","notes":"Bring your class list, find one dependable study area, and use the visit to identify where library help and research tools are located.","short_summary":"Finish with a practical study-space orientation before classes resume.","evidence_claim":"Louisiana Tech publishes fall, winter, and spring Sunday hours of 2–11 p.m. for Prescott Memorial Library.","source_url":"https://www.latech.edu/academics/library/about/library-hours.php","source_title":"Library Hours","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Fall, winter, and spring Sunday hours are 2–11 p.m.; summer Sunday hours are 5–9 p.m. Holiday and quarter-break hours can differ.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
